    effortless-ntwf:rulebookField effortless-ntwf:ElicitationSessions.ObserverStance ;
    effortless-ntwf:justification "Records how the observer took part: NonParticipantObservation in the close shadowing, Shadowing of Ken on press line 3, and LegitimatePeripheralParticipation when Sam fetched locks and staged tools for Tomas's crew while asking about each move." ;
    effortless-ntwf:semanticTypeIri "urn:effortless:pko-extension#ClaimEvidence" .

