    effortless-ntwf:justification "TRUE for small choices seen during actual practice: Ken resting a hand on the valve body after a bleed, Devon rechecking the FX rate before posting." ;
    effortless-ntwf:semanticTypeIri "urn:effortless:pko-extension#ClaimEvidence" .

