    effortless-ntwf:evidenceKind "Field" ;
    effortless-ntwf:rulebookField effortless-ntwf:KnowledgeGaps.IsUnattributedGatekeeping ;
    effortless-ntwf:justification "Fires when an elicitation recorded the holder declining to share, yet the gap is not identified as gatekeeping or sabotage: the night crew's tag-removal habit, left with no cause. It does not fire on the two gaps identified as gatekeeping and sabotage, nor on gaps with no refusal." ;
    effortless-ntwf:semanticTypeIri "urn:effortless:pko-extension#ClaimEvidence" .

