    effortless-ntwf:rulebookField effortless-ntwf:GovernedModels.IsImplementedWithoutRealData ;
    effortless-ntwf:justification "Fires for models never implemented by mapping the organization's real records into RDF: the policy model has only a synthetic mapping run, deployment and press have none. The lockout, close and register models were mapped from real data." ;
    effortless-ntwf:semanticTypeIri "urn:effortless:pko-extension#ClaimEvidence" .

