    effortless-ntwf:rulebookField effortless-ntwf:SemanticMappings.ReinventsStandardTerm ;
    effortless-ntwf:justification "Building on CIDOC CRM or Transmodel illustrates reuse-first engineering; this witness fires on terms minted although a reused standard already defines them, which is reuse-first being broken." ;
    effortless-ntwf:semanticTypeIri "urn:effortless:pko-extension#ClaimEvidence" .

