    effortless-ntwf:justification "One role specializes another: Senior Maintenance Technician specializes Maintenance Technician; the night safety deputy specializes the plant safety officer." ;
    effortless-ntwf:semanticTypeIri "urn:effortless:pko-extension#ClaimEvidence" .

