    effortless-ntwf:rulebookField effortless-ntwf:KnowledgeTraces.IsDocumentStartNeverValidated ;
    effortless-ntwf:justification "TRUE when a step first taken from a document has no validation captured from people. It fires on deploy-01 and loto-04, taken from the runbook and the SOP and never confirmed, and not on deploy-03 or loto-04b, confirmed at the release retrospective and the quarterly review; document knowledge treated as final is the breach." ;
    effortless-ntwf:semanticTypeIri "urn:effortless:pko-extension#ClaimEvidence" .

