    effortless-ntwf:rulebookField effortless-ntwf:KnowledgeTraces.IsDocumentStartNeverExtended ;
    effortless-ntwf:justification "TRUE when a step first taken from a document has never been extended by capture from people. It fires on deploy-01, deploy-03 and loto-04, and not on loto-04b, extended by night-shift field notes with the accumulator bleed the drawing omits." ;
    effortless-ntwf:semanticTypeIri "urn:effortless:pko-extension#ClaimEvidence" .

