    effortless-ntwf:rulebookField effortless-ntwf:Procedures.IsCapturedByAutomationAlone ;
    effortless-ntwf:justification "TRUE when a procedure's knowledge was captured by machine-authored entries and no practitioner relationship exists. Conveyor maintenance fires (only a copilot summary of vendor manuals); lockout/tagout, captured through relationships with Tomas and Lin, does not." ;
    effortless-ntwf:semanticTypeIri "urn:effortless:pko-extension#ClaimEvidence" .

