    effortless-ntwf:justification "A knowledge engineer asks who holds each piece of know-how; KnowHowCarriers.IsHeldByCurrentPractitioner answers it per carrier, TRUE for know-how carried by a person still in a role and FALSE for plants, systems and people who left." ;
    effortless-ntwf:semanticTypeIri "urn:effortless:pko-extension#ClaimEvidence" .

