    effortless-ntwf:justification "A knowledge engineer asks who knows where know-how is held; KnowledgeBrokerLinks.LocatesOtherHolder is TRUE when a broker points a seeker to know-how someone else carries (Lin pointing Aisha to Tomas)." ;
