    effortless-ntwf:rulebookField effortless-ntwf:Mentorships.EmployerWorkerObligation ;
    effortless-ntwf:justification "Records the obligations that make training worth investing in across generations: a guaranteed post and paid certification against a commitment to stay, a retention bonus at completion." ;
