    effortless-ntwf:rulebookField effortless-ntwf:OnboardingRecords.IsStartingFromNothing ;
    effortless-ntwf:justification "TRUE when a newcomer joins a procedure whose previous carriers left with nothing captured, so the work must be relearned from nothing. Leah's onboarding into customer incident response fires (Dmitri's triage heuristics left with him); starters on lockout and deployment, which have captured entries, read FALSE." ;
