    effortless-ntwf:rulebookField effortless-ntwf:AgentUpgradeAssessments.MissedTraversedImpact ;
    effortless-ntwf:justification "Fires when an upgrade assessment lists fewer affected steps than the traversal of the artifact-flow closure finds: the hand-written change ticket for 2.4.1 -> 2.5.0 listed only the release gate while traversal reaches deploy-03, deploy-04 and deploy-05; the traversal-based assessment does not fire." ;
    effortless-ntwf:semanticTypeIri "urn:effortless:pko-extension#ClaimEvidence" .

