    effortless-ntwf:justification "Asks which workflows contain steps consuming an AI agent's artifacts." ;
    effortless-ntwf:semanticTypeIri "urn:effortless:pko-extension#ClaimEvidence" .

effortless-ntwf:ont4-q27-e1 a effortless-ntwf:ClaimEvidence ;
    effortless-ntwf:__key "ont4-q27-e1" ;
    effortless-ntwf:claimEvidenceId "ont4-q27-e1" ;
    effortless-ntwf:articleClaim effortless-ntwf:ont4-q27 ;
    effortless-ntwf:evidenceKind "RoleQuestion" ;
    effortless-ntwf:roleQuestion effortless-ntwf:aq-ont4-q27 ;
    effortless-ntwf:justification "Asks which human person is currently accountable for each AI agent and flags AI agents with none." ;
    effortless-ntwf:semanticTypeIri "urn:effortless:pko-extension#ClaimEvidence" .

effortless-ntwf:ont4-i05-e1 a effortless-ntwf:ClaimEvidence ;
    effortless-ntwf:__key "ont4-i05-e1" ;
    effortless-ntwf:claimEvidenceId "ont4-i05-e1" ;
    effortless-ntwf:articleClaim effortless-ntwf:ont4-i05 ;
    effortless-ntwf:evidenceKind "Field" ;
    effortless-ntwf:rulebookField effortless-ntwf:RoleAssignmentUpdateTasks.StaleAssignmentBrokeRouting ;
    effortless-ntwf:justification "Separates a stale assignment that only made the model inaccurate from one that broke operations: it fires when the assignment was still stale at a run that needed it and that run's notice for the role reached the wrong person or nobody (the release manager and SRE departures before the 2026-07-14 hotfix), and not for the rollout operator's departure, equally stale at that run but routed nothing." ;
    effortless-ntwf:semanticTypeIri "urn:effortless:pko-extension#ClaimEvidence" .

effortless-ntwf:ont4-i23-e1 a effortless-ntwf:ClaimEvidence ;
    effortless-ntwf:__key "ont4-i23-e1" ;
    effortless-ntwf:claimEvidenceId "ont4-i23-e1" ;
    effortless-ntwf:articleClaim effortless-ntwf:ont4-i23 ;
    effortless-ntwf:evidenceKind "Field" ;
    effortless-ntwf:rulebookField effortless-ntwf:AiModelDeployments.IsIsolatedRegistryFact ;
    effortless-ntwf:justification "Fires for a live production deployment whose agent fills no role and has no attributed artifact in the graph: the release-notes writer is a registry row and nothing more, while the live 2.4.1 classifier deployment is connected to its role assignment and risk reports." ;
    effortless-ntwf:semanticTypeIri "urn:effortless:pko-extension#ClaimEvidence" .

effortless-ntwf:ont4-i24-e1 a effortless-ntwf:ClaimEvidence ;
    effortless-ntwf:__key "ont4-i24-e1" ;
    effortless-ntwf:claimEvidenceId "ont4-i24-e1" ;
    effortless-ntwf:articleClaim effortless-ntwf:ont4-i24 ;
    effortless-ntwf:evidenceKind "Field" ;
    effortless-ntwf:rulebookField effortless-ntwf:AssignmentRoutedNotices.ReachedWrongPersonOrNobody ;
    effortless-ntwf:justification "Fires when a notice went to someone who did not hold the step's role when it was sent, or to nobody: the hotfix approval notice went to Dmitri Volkov eleven days after he left, the hotfix health verification notice went to nobody, and the spreadsheet sent one to the VP; notices to Grace Holloway and to Leo Marchetti while he held the role do not fire." ;
    effortless-ntwf:semanticTypeIri "urn:effortless:pko-extension#ClaimEvidence" .

