    effortless-ntwf:notes "rulebook-to-owl v2026.09.14.2309: COUNTIFS keyed on a non-PK field of the row, verbatim __key on every individual (keys containing '|'), blank-safe concatenation under erbBlankLogic=coerce, '#' inside a string literal compared whole, a scalar wrapped around an aggregation, and a refusal when two tables share a PK value (RulebookReleases key renamed pko-release-1.0.0). OWL 100%; every substrate with a closure engine agrees on all 67,616 cells; only xlsx (no closure engine) is short." ;
