effortless-ntwf:aq-pkm3-q04 a effortless-ntwf:RoleQuestions ;
    effortless-ntwf:__key "aq-pkm3-q04" ;
    effortless-ntwf:roleQuestionId "aq-pkm3-q04" ;
    effortless-ntwf:askingRole effortless-ntwf:platform-infrastructure-engineer ;
    effortless-ntwf:witnessLoop effortless-ntwf:loop-08 ;
    effortless-ntwf:questionText "Which of our operations help each other, which require each other, and which work against each other?" ;
    effortless-ntwf:whyItMatters "When a deployment destabilizes the ledger integrations during the close, the two operations are coupled whether or not anyone wrote it down." ;
