    effortless-ntwf:witnessLoop effortless-ntwf:loop-08 ;
    effortless-ntwf:questionText "Does every value an execution records have the datatype and format its step variable declares?" ;
    effortless-ntwf:whyItMatters "A risk report pasted into chat as text is not the machine-readable report the approval gate is specified to read." ;
